  "quest.3E0191A718C8CFF9.quest_subtitle": "Survive 24 Hours Without Dying",
  "quest.0D35D0D33922A201.quest_desc": [
    "A &aGate Pearl&r opens a gateway that sends waves of mobs at you, and JEI shows how to craft each one.",
    "",
    "A gateway fails if a mob can't spawn, a mob walks too far away or the wave timer runs out, so open it on flat, open ground.",
  ],
  "quest.1F70A066744E64EA.quest_desc": [
